{"title":"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_5\">Problem 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/6/336eb74d04f3b62480acb927737f2939de8a9a93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(256\\right)^{.16}\\left(256\\right)^{.09}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"120\" height=\"21\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/9/50955d8ee5cc094c7ddfdcba2c89bf5288aa1a41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(B)}\\ 16\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(C)}\\ 64\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ 256.25\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ -16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"84\" height=\"96\" /> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When we multiply numbers with exponents, we add the exponents together and leave the bases unchanged. We can apply this concept to computate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/3/c5317d0fc862d90b1f8a6c9bbc65bba43f1860b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$256^{0.16} \\cdot 256^{0.09}$\" width=\"115\" height=\"15\" />: \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/3/31384237d46ca82b0154788ab73b9df0bc2c89c5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[256^{0.16} \\cdot 256^{0.09} = 256^{0.16+0.09}=256^{0.25}.\\]\" width=\"306\" height=\"15\" />\nNow we can convert the decimal exponent to a fraction: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/d/c1d16907bb57ffe5cd7691716308a373307be0c6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[256^{0.25} = 256^{\\frac{1}{4}}.\\]\" width=\"117\" height=\"18\" />\nNow, let us convert the expression into radical form. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is the denominator of the fractional exponent, it will be the index exponent: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/f/c1f0d3747b9ac71a5fcace8ede61809f935fa386.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[256^{\\frac{1}{4}}=\\sqrt[4]{256}.\\]\" width=\"108\" height=\"19\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/b/c5b707ed09e26e0beef94411137f3dec53c926bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$256 =16^2=(4^2)^2=4^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"179\" height=\"19\" />, we can solve for the fourth root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/d/abd678361b0f40ec2723283c0f2bab3df5cadc68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$256$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/8/6f8b2a71bcd4bb50876530774b5c9972f0190ab9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt[4]{256}=\\sqrt[4]{4^4}=4.\\]\" width=\"135\" height=\"19\" />\nTherefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/9/089692a0bfa70b7c6467a6b224aed60d8e5e2375.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(256)^{.16} \\cdot (256)^{.09}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }\\ 4}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"221\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME\" title=\"1959 AHSME\">1959 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1959 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1959\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=